/* PRIVACY SCALE AND ONWARD ROUTES, added 2026-08-30 with the SEO pass. Both sit
   on the shared page canvas rather than carrying their own band, per the
   continuous-background rule: the card is the contrast, not the section. */
.fg-obscure-scale__list {
