/* Qualified with the row, not left as a bare class. `.fg-obscure-scale__row p`
   above is (0,1,1) and would beat a lone `.fg-obscure-scale__names` at (0,1,0),
   so the margin would silently do nothing -- the namespaced-element-beats-class
   trap this stylesheet already records. `!important` would also have worked and
   is the wrong answer. */
