/* THIS RULE WAS DEAD AND STILL WON. It set every h2 on the route to
   `clamp(1.9rem, 2.8vw, 2.8rem) !important`, and a second blanket rule ~1,450
   lines below set them all again to `clamp(1.55rem, 2vw, 2rem) !important`,
   which is where the 28.8px every heading on the page resolved to came from.
   Two `!important` blanket rules fighting each other is why nothing on a
   13,909px page could be made more important than anything else. Both are
   neutered 2026-08-27; the surviving one keeps this route's heading weight and
   tracking and leaves the size to the house rule and the chapter heads. */
